<!DOCTYPE concept
  PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="_Toc235706034" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Missing or weak short descriptions</title>
   <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>short</keyword>
        <keyword>Missing</keyword>
        <keyword>descriptions</keyword>
        <keyword>summaries</keyword>
        <keyword>purpose</keyword>
        <keyword>topic</keyword>
        <indexterm>short</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Missing</indexterm>
        <indexterm>descriptions</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>
         <b>Problem:</b> Topics lack <codeph>&lt;shortdesc&gt;</codeph> or have vague, unhelpful summaries.</p>
      <p>
         <b>Impact:</b> Reduced searchability, poor link previews, unclear content purpose.</p>
      <p>
         <b>Solution:</b> Write concise, meaningful summaries for every topic. Ensure the short description clearly communicates the topic's purpose.</p>
   </conbody>
</concept>
